# Exported browser cookies. www.youtube.com_cookies.txt has been sitting in the
# root untracked, holding 23 live Google session cookies -- HSID, SSID, SAPISID,
# LOGIN_INFO, __Secure-1PSIDTS. This repo is PUBLIC, so a single `git add -A`
# would have published a working session for that Google account.
#
# It has never been committed; checked across every branch. This is here so
# that stays true by rule rather than by remembering not to.
*cookies*.txt
*.cookies

# Working copies kept beside the real file.
*.bak

# Recordings and screen captures kept locally for reference. The Screenshot
# folder alone is ~300MB and the video 35MB; committing either would make the
# repo unusable to clone, and neither is needed to build or run the app.
*.mp4
*.mov
Screenshot/

# Database snapshots from tools/export-supabase.js.
# NEVER commit these to this repo: it is public, and the snapshot contains
# congregation contact details (roster_member_meta holds names, emails, phone
# numbers, notes and suspension reasons; pic_users holds names and phones).
backups/
